# Syntax Timeline

As a first-year graduate student at UCLA I developed an [interactive timeline of the history of generative syntax]({static}/timeline/main.html).
It really helped me get a better understanding of the field and how its core ideas have developed over the years.
I haven't had much time since then to work on it, and it's pretty broken by now.
If you are interested in reviving this project, please shoot me a line.
